{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>and they shall subdue</b> — fortresses, and sling stones will not avail the enemies in their fortresses." "And the meaning of 'sling stones' — the princes of Greece." "And the meaning of 'they shall drink' — that they shall pour the blood of the slingers into the basin with which the blood is dashed upon the corners of the altar, and the meaning is doubled."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:32.294139058Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}